    "B": "MRI is more sensitive for some brain injuries but is slower and less suitable in the acute emergency setting.",
    "C": "CT is the preferred acute investigation for suspected intracranial injury after stabilisation.",
    "D": "Skull x-ray does not reliably assess intracranial injury and is not the appropriate test here."
